{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00608",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 9.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.74,
      "text": "Hi, come on in. Wow, you look soaked. Is it still pouring out there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.87,
      "end_seconds": 21.53,
      "duration_seconds": 10.66,
      "text": "Pouring. And the parking garage was full, so I walked six blocks. I'm sorry, I'm a few minutes late."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.4,
      "end_seconds": 29.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "Not at all. Sit, catch your breath. We have plenty of time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.72,
      "end_seconds": 38.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "Thank you. I made notes, if that's okay. I didn't want to forget anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.04,
      "end_seconds": 46.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "Please, notes are a gift. What would you like to start with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.22,
      "end_seconds": 59.8,
      "duration_seconds": 11.58,
      "text": "I found a lump in my left breast, in the shower last week. I wrote down the date, and the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.65,
      "end_seconds": 67.8,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "That must have been frightening. Tell me what you noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.23,
      "end_seconds": 80.12,
      "duration_seconds": 10.89,
      "text": "It's about the size of a pea, firm, on the outer side. And it's a little tender when I press it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.08,
      "end_seconds": 89.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "Thank you. And how long do you think it has been there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.9,
      "end_seconds": 102.95,
      "duration_seconds": 11.05,
      "text": "That's the thing, I really can't say. It might have been last month, or the month before. I only noticed it last week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.16,
      "end_seconds": 116.57,
      "duration_seconds": 11.41,
      "text": "That's very common. These lumps are usually found by accident. Have you seen any fluid from the nipple?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.16,
      "end_seconds": 122.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.32,
      "end_seconds": 130.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "And any change in the skin, like dimpling or puckering?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.74,
      "end_seconds": 137.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "No dimpling. I checked in the mirror, twice."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.54,
      "end_seconds": 146.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "Good. Now, tell me about your health in general. Anything ongoing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.21,
      "end_seconds": 151.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "An underactive thyroid. That's the only thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.97,
      "end_seconds": 157.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "And what do you take for it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.41,
      "end_seconds": 168.09,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "Levothyroxine. I think it's maybe 75 micrograms? I'd have to check the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.05,
      "end_seconds": 180.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.44,
      "text": "That's fine, we can confirm it with your pharmacy. Once a day, in the morning?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.06,
      "end_seconds": 188.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Every morning, before breakfast. I'm quite strict about that one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.47,
      "end_seconds": 193.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Wonderful. Anything else you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.53,
      "end_seconds": 204.63,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "The contraceptive pill, once a day, in the evening. Although, I have to be honest, I miss it some evenings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.49,
      "end_seconds": 212.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "Thank you for telling me. Is it most evenings you remember, or fewer?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.79,
      "end_seconds": 223.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "I take it every day, I believe. But my diary has a few gaps, so I'm not certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.23,
      "end_seconds": 231.53,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "text": "Okay. Then let's say we're not certain, and we'll come back to it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.28,
      "end_seconds": 237.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Is that important for the lump?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.44,
      "end_seconds": 248.71,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "It can be, hormones play a role in how breast tissue behaves, which is why I ask."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.5,
      "end_seconds": 258.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "I see. I wrote that my aunt had breast cancer. I should have said that first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.69,
      "end_seconds": 268.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "I'm glad you did. Which side of the family is your aunt on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.58,
      "end_seconds": 275.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "My mother's side. She was diagnosed in her fifties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.06,
      "end_seconds": 283.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "Thank you. Knowing that, we'll be a little more careful with you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.57,
      "end_seconds": 290.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "So what do you think this is? Please be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.63,
      "end_seconds": 303.39,
      "duration_seconds": 10.76,
      "text": "Honestly, from your description, a small, firm, tender lump, it's most likely a benign cyst. But I won't leave it at a guess."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.22,
      "end_seconds": 308.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "What do we do, then?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.89,
      "end_seconds": 321.89,
      "duration_seconds": 11.0,
      "text": "I'll order a breast ultrasound, so we can see exactly what it is. The scheduler will call you with an appointment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.61,
      "end_seconds": 326.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "And if it's something worse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.81,
      "end_seconds": 339.61,
      "duration_seconds": 11.8,
      "text": "Then we'd know early, and we'd act. Right now, there's nothing to suggest that, so please try not to spiral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.5,
      "end_seconds": 344.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I'll try. I keep imagining things."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.03,
      "end_seconds": 354.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.76,
      "text": "I understand. I'd like to see you again next Friday, to go over the ultrasound together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.59,
      "end_seconds": 364.52,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Next Friday. I'll put it in my notes. Thank you for taking time, doctor."
    }
  ]
}
